# Bad unicode escapes.
mode: syntax
---- query
from '\u{110000}' '\uABCD'
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..27
  PIPELINE@0..26
    IDENT@0..4 "from"
    WHITESPACE@4..5 " "
    LITERAL@5..17
      STRING@5..17 "'\\u{110000}'"
    WHITESPACE@17..18 " "
    ERROR@18..26
      STRING@18..26 "'\\uABCD'"
  WHITESPACE@26..27 "\n"

error[DS0005]: invalid unicode escape `\u{110000}`
  --> query:1:7
  |
1 | from '\u{110000}' '\uABCD'
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^ not a valid unicode escape
  |
  = help: write `\u{` followed by 1 to 6 hex digits and `}`, e.g. `\u{1F600}`

error[DS0101]: expected `|` or `;`, found `'\uABCD'`
  --> query:1:19
  |
1 | from '\u{110000}' '\uABCD'
  |                   ^^^^^^^^

error[DS0005]: invalid unicode escape `\u`
  --> query:1:20
  |
1 | from '\u{110000}' '\uABCD'
  |                    ^^ not a valid unicode escape
  |
  = help: write `\u{` followed by 1 to 6 hex digits and `}`, e.g. `\u{1F600}`
